Package: shadowfetch-defaults
Version: 2.1.2-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Shadowfetch Project <maintainers@shadowfetch.com>
Installed-Size: 272
Depends: fastfetch, python3, python3-pyqt6
Recommends: shadowfetch-themes, shadowfetch-branding, papirus-icon-theme, konsole, xdg-utils, snapper, grub-btrfs
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://shadowfetch.com/linux/
Description: Shadowfetch default user configuration
 Ships the Shadowfetch defaults applied to new user accounts (via
 /etc/skel): kdeglobals, kwinrc, konsole profile, fastfetch config.
 Also ships a system-wide /etc/profile.d snippet that prints a
 fastfetch banner on the first interactive shell, plus the Shadowfetch
 Control Center, safe updater, health diagnostics and agent workspace tools.
